"{\"eval_set_result_id\":\"first_agent_evalset351450_1767729397.4522154\",\"eval_set_result_name\":\"first_agent_evalset351450_1767729397.4522154\",\"eval_set_id\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_case_results\":[{\"eval_set_file\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_set_id\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_id\":\"case890372\",\"final_eval_status\":2,\"eval_metric_results\":null,\"overall_eval_metric_results\":[{\"metric_name\":\"tool_trajectory_avg_score\",\"threshold\":1.0,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":1.0,\"eval_status\":1,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}},{\"metric_name\":\"response_match_score\",\"threshold\":0.7,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":0.6368159203980099,\"eval_status\":2,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}}],\"eval_metric_result_per_invocation\":[{\"actual_invocation\":{\"invocation_id\":\"e-939e0f7c-a2f9-40dd-81fc-45d6c83d40b1\",\"user_content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"What is Agent Development Kit from Google? What languages is the SDK available in?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"final_response\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"Google's \\\"Agent Development Kit\\\" (ADK) isn't a single, uniquely named product but rather refers to the comprehensive set of tools, services, and APIs that Google provides for building, deploying, and managing AI agents, particularly conversational and generative AI agents.\\n\\nIt's primarily centered around:\\n\\n1.  **Vertex AI Agent Builder**: This is a key component within Google Cloud's Vertex AI platform. It provides a managed environment and tools specifically designed for developing and deploying generative AI agents. It leverages Google's large language models (like Gemini) and other AI services to help developers create agents that can understand natural language, engage in multi-turn conversations, perform actions, and integrate with enterprise data and systems.\\n2.  **Gemini API and SDKs**: The core intelligence of these agents often comes from Google's Gemini family of models. The Gemini API allows developers to access these powerful models, and the associated SDKs facilitate easy integration into applications.\\n3.  **Other Google Cloud AI Services**: The \\\"kit\\\" also implicitly includes the ability to integrate with a broader range of Google Cloud AI services, such as Speech-to-Text, Text-to-Speech, Natural Language API, and more, to build richer agent experiences.\\n\\nIn essence, the ADK empowers developers to build sophisticated AI agents that can automate tasks, provide customer support, assist users, and integrate generative AI capabilities into their applications.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Available SDK Languages\\n\\nThe underlying SDKs and client libraries that make up the \\\"Agent Development Kit\\\" (specifically for interacting with Vertex AI Agent Builder components and the Gemini API) are generally available in several popular programming languages. The most commonly supported ones include:\\n\\n*   **Python** (often the primary language for AI/ML development)\\n*   **Node.js** (JavaScript)\\n*   **Java**\\n*   **Go**\\n*   **C#**\\n\\nThese languages offer robust client libraries that simplify interaction with Google Cloud's AI services, allowing developers to build and integrate agents into a wide variety of applications and environments.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"intermediate_data\":{\"invocation_events\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":1767729397.42153,\"rubrics\":null,\"app_details\":{\"agent_details\":{\"root_agent\":{\"name\":\"root_agent\",\"instructions\":\"Answer user questions to the best of your knowledge\\n\\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \\\"root_agent\\\". The description about you is \\\"A helpful assistant for user questions.\\\".\",\"tool_declarations\":[]}}}},\"expected_invocation\":{\"invocation_id\":\"e-31b23071-683b-466c-9570-045e6419c4d7\",\"user_content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"What is Agent Development Kit from Google? What languages is the SDK available in?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"final_response\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"The **Agent Development Kit (ADK)** from Google is a set of tools, libraries, and frameworks designed to help developers create and integrate generative AI agents into their applications and services. It's particularly focused on making it easier to build intelligent agents that can understand natural language, engage in multi-turn conversations, perform actions, and leverage various AI models (like Gemini) and services.\\n\\nEssentially, the ADK aims to simplify the complex process of:\\n*   **Orchestrating AI models**: Connecting to and managing various generative AI models.\\n*   **Tool Use**: Enabling agents to use external tools (APIs, databases, web searches) to fetch information or perform actions.\\n*   **Memory Management**: Giving agents the ability to remember past interactions and context.\\n*   **Prompt Engineering**: Providing structures and helpers for designing effective prompts.\\n*   **Evaluation and Deployment**: Tools for testing, debugging, and deploying agents.\\n\\nIt's part of Google's broader AI platform, enabling developers to build sophisticated conversational and task-oriented agents.\\n\\nRegarding the **languages the SDK is available in**, Google typically provides its SDKs and client libraries for AI and cloud services in several popular languages to cater to a wide developer audience. While specific availability can evolve, the primary languages for Google's AI SDKs, including those relevant to an ADK, generally include:\\n\\n*   **Python**: Very common for AI/ML development due to its rich ecosystem of libraries.\\n*   **Java**: Widely used in enterprise applications.\\n*   **Node.js (JavaScript)**: Popular for web development and backend services.\\n*   **Go**: Google's own language, known for its performance and concurrency.\\n*   **C# (.NET)**: Used by developers in the Microsoft ecosystem.\\n\\nWhen building agents, developers might also interact with APIs directly using any language capable of making HTTP requests, but the SDKs provide a more integrated and idiomatic way to interact with the underlying services.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"intermediate_data\":{\"tool_uses\":[],\"tool_responses\":[],\"intermediate_responses\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":1767729068.439695,\"rubrics\":null,\"app_details\":null},\"eval_metric_results\":[{\"metric_name\":\"tool_trajectory_avg_score\",\"threshold\":1.0,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":1.0,\"eval_status\":1,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}},{\"metric_name\":\"response_match_score\",\"threshold\":0.7,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":0.6368159203980099,\"eval_status\":2,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}}]}],\"session_id\":\"___eval___session___c8b4848f-d050-49ef-9bd1-724b333c3d47\",\"session_details\":{\"id\":\"___eval___session___c8b4848f-d050-49ef-9bd1-724b333c3d47\",\"app_name\":\"first_agent\",\"user_id\":\"user\",\"state\":{\"__llm_request_key__\":\"79b77634-f449-4c3c-8229-112c6b26ffea\"},\"events\":[{\"model_version\":null,\"conte